    "「AIで翻訳」は前後の字幕も読んで自然な訳にします(いまの AI: ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Translate with AI” also reads the surrounding captions for a natural translation (current AI: "
          }
        },
        "es": {
