          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Escolha novamente em “Escolher foto”.\n\nDetalhes: "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "もう一度「書き出す」を押してください。続くときは、解像度や画質を下げるか、アプリを開き直してからお試しください。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Press “Export” again. If it keeps happening, lower the resolution or quality, or reopen the app and try again."
